  "description": "Enhance Compatible with 2022-2026 Nissan Pathfinder with custom-fit TPE floor mats and a cargo liner designed to offer full 3-row protection for 7-Seaters models. Crafted using advanced 3D laser scanning technology, these mats ensure precise alignment, providing seamless coverage for every part of your vehicle’s interior. Made from 100% recyclable and non-toxic materials, these mats are eco-friendly and safe for both humans and pets. The high-edge, all-weather design protects against dirt, mud, snow, and spills, while the anti-slip texture and bottom fixation system ensure that the mats stay securely in place. This complete set includes floor liners for the 1st, 2nd, and 3rd rows, along with a cargo mat for maximum protection. Easy to install and clean, these mats are the perfect addition to your Nissan Pathfinder, keeping it in pristine condition year-round.\nFeatures\nPrecision Fit: Designed specifically for 2022-2025 Nissan Pathfinder 7-passenger models, ensuring perfect alignment using advanced 3D laser scanning.\nEco-Friendly Materials: Made from 100% recyclable, non-toxic TPE material, safe for both humans and pets, and free from harmful chemicals.\nAll-Weather Defense: High-edge design provides comprehensive protection from dirt, mud, rain, snow, and spills, keeping your vehicle's interior clean year-round.\nNon-Slip & Secure: Features a bottom fixation system and anti-slip texture to keep mats securely in place during daily driving.\nComplete Coverage: Includes full floor liner set for 1st, 2nd, and 3rd rows, plus a custom cargo liner, delivering total interior protection.\n2-Year Warranty | Professional installation is highly recommended for safety.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2022-2026 Nissan Pathfinder 7-passenger models.\nNot fit to Vinyl Floors.",
  "highlights": [
